[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8761.63, "timestamp": "02:26:01", "text": "天空弧系统已趋于稳定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8766.23, "timestamp": "02:26:06", "text": "多年前，他从救援装置中醒来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8768.389, "timestamp": "02:26:08", "text": "不久前，这间小木屋被一场空洞风暴覆盖了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8772.67, "timestamp": "02:26:12", "text": "正在进行中。尼奥，那个指挥官也发生了变异。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8774.429, "timestamp": "02:26:14", "text": "我甚至失去了理智。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8811.75, "timestamp": "02:26:51", "text": "看看它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8812.75, "timestamp": "02:26:52", "text": "一个，"}]